# Tazza Produce — environment template
#
# This file (env.example) is committed on purpose; it is NOT a .env file.
# NEVER commit .env or .env.local.
#
# There are NO required environment variables for this project.
# - Local dev: `npm run dev` works with zero env config.
# - Vercel production: the platform auto-injects VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL,
#   which next.config.mjs / app/layout.tsx use for metadataBase + OG tags.
#   No action needed.
#
# This build has no payments, no Supabase, and no API keys.
# (The earlier Stripe integration was removed; /shop uses UberEats/DoorDash links.)
